    <item>
      <title>淘宝“帮我挑”：AI开始“教”我们花钱了，钱包君还好吗？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20250908131004681-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Sep 2025 13:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
